      "justification": "A cross-national longitudinal dataset launched in 2020 covering multiple European and Eurasian countries (including Belarus, Czech Republic, Estonia, France, Germany, Netherlands, Norway, Poland, and Sweden) that collects microdata on gender relations, household division of labor, fertility, and gender role attitudes."
    },
