      "justification": "Covers transition and European economies (such as Albania, Armenia, Azerbaijan, Belarus, Bosnia and Herzegovina, Bulgaria, Croatia, Czech Republic, Estonia, Georgia, Hungary, Italy, Latvia, Lithuania, Montenegro, North Macedonia, Poland, Romania, Russian Federation, Serbia, Slovakia, Slovenia, and Ukraine) measuring gender equality, employment, social dynamics, and lived experiences in the 2020s."
